\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\fs24 \AppleTypeServices \cf3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Deterministic Safety vs. Agentic Flexibility:
\f2\b0  Combining autonomous AI adaptability with rigid health safety was a primary challenge. We solved this by enforcing a hybrid architecture: deterministic rule-based calculation for metabolic baselines paired with agentic reasoning for contextual plan adaptation.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Offline Reliability:
\f2\b0  Fitness apps must work in gyms with spotty cell reception. We engineered 
\f8\fs26 \cb9 StructuredUserIntent
\f2\fs24 \cb1  and 
\f8\fs26 \cb9 DeterministicFallbackProvider
\f2\fs24 \cb1  to parse queries and adapt plans locally without requiring active cloud LLM connections.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Consumer UI Refinement:
\f2\b0  Early versions exposed technical developer terms (Node Pipeline, Vector Embeddings, Execution Graph). We overhauled the UI into Apple-level consumer language (Your Profile, Today's Signals, Smart Decision, Plan Adaptation, Learning From You).\
\ls4\ilvl0
